{"source_lang": "ta", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "வணக்கம்", "target_text": "ನಮಸ್ಕಾರ", "category": "greetings"}
{"source_lang": "ta", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "காலை வணக்கம்", "target_text": "ಶುಭೋದಯ", "category": "greetings"}
{"source_lang": "ta", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "நன்றி", "target_text": "ಧನ್ಯವಾದಗಳು", "category": "courtesy"}
{"source_lang": "ta", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "புத்தகத்தைத் திறக்கவும்.", "target_text": "ಪುಸ್ತಕವನ್ನು ತೆರೆಯಿರಿ.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "ta", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "எழுந்து நில்லுங்கள்.", "target_text": "ಎದ್ದು ನಿಲ್ಲಿ.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "ta", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "உட்காருங்கள்.", "target_text": "ಕುಳಿತುಕೊಳ್ಳಿ.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "ta", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "எண் ஐந்தை எழுதுங்கள்.", "target_text": "ಐದು ಸಂಖ್ಯೆಯನ್ನು ಬರೆಯಿರಿ.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "ta", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "பொருட்களை எண்ணுங்கள்.", "target_text": "ವಸ್ತುಗಳನ್ನು ಎಣಿಸಿ.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "ta", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "படத்தைப் பாருங்கள்.", "target_text": "ಚಿತ್ರವನ್ನು ನೋಡಿ.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "ta", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "இந்த வார்த்தையைப் படியுங்கள்.", "target_text": "ಈ ಪದವನ್ನು ಓದಿ.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "ta", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "என் பின்னால் சொல்லுங்கள்.", "target_text": "ನನ್ನ ನಂತರ ಪುನರಾವರ್ತಿಸಿ.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "ta", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "யார் பதில் சொல்ல முடியும்?", "target_text": "ಯಾರು ಉತ್ತರಿಸಬಹುದು?", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "ta", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "ஒன்று (1)", "target_text": "ಒಂದು (1)", "category": "numbers"}
{"source_lang": "ta", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "இரண்டு (2)", "target_text": "ಎರಡು (2)", "category": "numbers"}
{"source_lang": "ta", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "ஐந்து (5)", "target_text": "ಐದು (5)", "category": "numbers"}
